<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in; background-color: white">Emerging
growth company <span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_907_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20230523__20230523_z53p7JhLM1U7"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-05-23to2023-05-23" format="ixt:booleanfalse" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#168;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></span></span></p>

