<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; background-color: white">
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="width: 0.25in"><span style="font-size: 10pt"><b>3.</b></span></td>
    <td><span style="font-size: 10pt"><b>Advisory Vote on the Company&#8217;s Executive Compensation. &#160;</b></span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Stockholders approved (on
an advisory basis) the Company&#8217;s executive compensation, in accordance with the voting results below.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>

